trace-compare
Reference implementation for "Trace Comparison for Actionable Diagnostics and
Improvement of Agentic Systems".

This repository contains code derived from the following projects, both
Copyright 2025 CUGA and licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  cuga-eval   https://github.com/cuga-project/cuga-eval
    The comparison analytics under analytics/trace_comparison_rules/ is the
    source of the code in src/trace_compare/ and of the comparison rules in
    examples/cuga_appworld/.

  cuga-agent  https://github.com/cuga-project/cuga-agent
    The component system prompts in examples/cuga_appworld/prompts/ originate
    from the CUGA agent.

Changes made to the derived files: restructured into an installable package,
removed the dependency on the cuga-eval bundle layout, and added a command-line
interface, a structured divergence output, a synthetic example and tests.
